From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SacredTrees <121399723+SacredTrees@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:13:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] libstdc++: build the float math stubs with -fno-builtin

Where configure finds no floorf, ceilf or sqrtf in the C library (AmigaOS
with libnix), math_stubs_float.cc defines each as (float) of the double
function. With builtins on, GCC narrows (float) floor ((double) x) back
into floorf (x), so floorf, ceilf and sqrtf called themselves until the
stack ran out (WarMUX's Play hung in sqrtf, 25 Nov 2026). Built with
-fno-builtin they call floor, ceil and sqrt.

Team 2
---
 libstdc++-v3/src/c++98/Makefile.am | 9 +++++++++
 libstdc++-v3/src/c++98/Makefile.in | 9 +++++++++
 2 files changed, 18 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libstdc++-v3/src/c++98/Makefile.am b/libstdc++-v3/src/c++98/Makefile.am
index e816356..5ae6f81 100644
--- a/libstdc++-v3/src/c++98/Makefile.am
+++ b/libstdc++-v3/src/c++98/Makefile.am
@@ -185,6 +185,15 @@ strstream.lo: strstream.cc
 strstream.o: strstream.cc
 	$(CXXCOMPILE) -I$(GLIBCXX_INCLUDE_DIR)/backward -Wno-deprecated -c $<
 
+# The float stubs (built where configure finds no floorf, ceilf, sqrtf...
+# in the C library, as on AmigaOS with libnix) call the double functions:
+# with builtins on, GCC narrows (float) floor (x) back into floorf (x), and
+# floorf, ceilf and sqrtf call themselves until the stack runs out.
+math_stubs_float.lo: math_stubs_float.cc
+	$(LTCXXCOMPILE) -fno-builtin -c $<
+math_stubs_float.o: math_stubs_float.cc
+	$(CXXCOMPILE) -fno-builtin -c $<
+
 # Use special rules for the concept-checking instantiations so that all
 # the generated template functions are also instantiated.  Force the checks
 # to be on so that the instantiations are actually seen.
diff --git a/libstdc++-v3/src/c++98/Makefile.in b/libstdc++-v3/src/c++98/Makefile.in
index 1a3ab12..8065639 100644
--- a/libstdc++-v3/src/c++98/Makefile.in
+++ b/libstdc++-v3/src/c++98/Makefile.in
@@ -902,6 +902,15 @@ strstream.lo: strstream.cc
 strstream.o: strstream.cc
 	$(CXXCOMPILE) -I$(GLIBCXX_INCLUDE_DIR)/backward -Wno-deprecated -c $<
 
+# The float stubs (built where configure finds no floorf, ceilf, sqrtf...
+# in the C library, as on AmigaOS with libnix) call the double functions:
+# with builtins on, GCC narrows (float) floor (x) back into floorf (x), and
+# floorf, ceilf and sqrtf call themselves until the stack runs out.
+math_stubs_float.lo: math_stubs_float.cc
+	$(LTCXXCOMPILE) -fno-builtin -c $<
+math_stubs_float.o: math_stubs_float.cc
+	$(CXXCOMPILE) -fno-builtin -c $<
+
 # Use special rules for the concept-checking instantiations so that all
 # the generated template functions are also instantiated.  Force the checks
 # to be on so that the instantiations are actually seen.
